---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="GradeVine — Grading software for paper-and-pencil classrooms."
  description="Grade handwritten quizzes, tests, lab questions, problem sets, and free-response work in about a minute per student — from the phone or iPad you already carry."
>
  <!-- Header -->
  <header class="header">
    <nav class="nav">
      <div class="logo">
        <span class="logo-text">GradeVine</span>
      </div>
      <div class="nav-links">
        <a href="https://apps.apple.com/app/id6755069483" class="btn btn-nav">Download on the App Store</a>
      </div>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <div class="hero-carousel" aria-label="App screenshots">
        <div class="carousel-track">
          <img src="/carousel/01_identity.png" alt="GradeVine classes and assignments view" />
          <img src="/carousel/02_workflow.png" alt="Grading workflow with handwriting recognition" />
          <img src="/carousel/03_insight.png" alt="Analytics dashboard with grade distributions" />
          <img src="/carousel/04_quick_feedback.png" alt="Reusable feedback comments" />
          <img src="/carousel/05_export.png" alt="Export options for graded work" />
        </div>
        <div class="carousel-dots">
          <button class="carousel-dot active" aria-label="Slide 1"></button>
          <button class="carousel-dot" aria-label="Slide 2"></button>
          <button class="carousel-dot" aria-label="Slide 3"></button>
          <button class="carousel-dot" aria-label="Slide 4"></button>
          <button class="carousel-dot" aria-label="Slide 5"></button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-text">
        <h1>Grading software for <span class="highlight">paper-and-pencil classrooms.</span></h1>
        <h2 class="hero-subtitle">Grade handwritten work in about a minute per student — from the phone or iPad you already carry.</h2>
        <div class="hero-cta">
          <a href="https://apps.apple.com/app/id6755069483" class="btn btn-primary">Download on the App Store</a>
          <p class="hero-microcopy">Free to try. 30 credits. No card required.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- How GradeVine works -->
  <section id="how-it-works" class="how-it-works">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>How GradeVine works.</h2>

      <div class="how-step">
        <div class="how-step-text">
          <div class="how-step-header"><span class="how-step-number">1</span><h3>Upload a blank copy of your assignment.</h3></div>
          <p>Photograph it or import a PDF, and GradeVine pulls out the questions for you. No typing them in. Add a rubric and keywords for each question, or let GradeVine suggest them.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="how-step-visual">
          <video autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="none" poster="/videos/1-upload-assignment.jpg">
            <source src="/videos/1-upload-assignment.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
          </video>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="how-step reverse">
        <div class="how-step-text">
          <div class="how-step-header"><span class="how-step-number">2</span><h3>Import student work.</h3></div>
          <p>GradeVine matches each page to the right student on your roster automatically, so you're not sorting by hand.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="how-step-visual">
          <video autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="none" poster="/videos/2-import-student-work.jpg">
            <source src="/videos/2-import-student-work.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
          </video>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="how-step">
        <div class="how-step-text">
          <div class="how-step-header"><span class="how-step-number">3</span><h3>Grade with a tap, by question or by student.</h3></div>
          <p>Move through the answers and tap to score, whichever way you'd rather work.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="how-step-visual">
          <video autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="none" poster="/videos/3-grade-with-a-tap.jpg">
            <source src="/videos/3-grade-with-a-tap.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
          </video>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="how-step reverse">
        <div class="how-step-text">
          <div class="how-step-header"><span class="how-step-number">4</span><h3>Reuse the feedback you use most often.</h3></div>
          <p>Save the comments you reach for again and again, apply them with a tap, then export the feedback to hand back to students.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="how-step-visual">
          <video autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="none" poster="/videos/4-reuse-feedback.jpg">
            <source src="/videos/4-reuse-feedback.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
          </video>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="how-step">
        <div class="how-step-text">
          <div class="how-step-header"><span class="how-step-number">5</span><h3>Use smart features to speed up your grading.</h3></div>
          <p>Semantic matching recognizes when answers mean the same thing. Look for "Water" and "H₂O" still counts. And if you want a head start, Smart evaluation reads each answer and suggests right, partly right, or wrong with a reason. You make the final call.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="how-step-visual">
          <video autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="none" poster="/videos/5-smart-features.jpg">
            <source src="/videos/5-smart-features.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
          </video>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="how-step reverse">
        <div class="how-step-text">
          <div class="how-step-header"><span class="how-step-number">6</span><h3>See exactly what the class understood.</h3></div>
          <p>Class averages, score distributions, per-question success rates, and keyword coverage all build as you grade, so you can see which questions tripped everyone up, which students are falling behind, and how the class is trending across assignments. Nothing to set up. It's there the moment you finish.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="how-step-visual">
          <video autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="none" poster="/videos/6-class-analytics.jpg">
            <source src="/videos/6-class-analytics.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
          </video>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="how-also">Also: blind grading mode hides student names until you're done.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Trend stat strip -->
  <section class="trend-strip">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Handwritten assignments are coming back.</h2>

      <div class="stat-grid">
        <div class="stat-block">
          <div class="stat-number">66%</div>
          <p class="stat-body">of high school and college teachers are rethinking assignments because of AI cheating.</p>
          <a href="https://www.edweek.org/technology/teachers-turn-to-pen-and-paper-amid-ai-cheating-fears-survey-finds/2023/10" class="stat-source" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Education Week, October 2023</a>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-block">
          <div class="stat-number">76%</div>
          <p class="stat-body">of those teachers are bringing handwritten work back into the classroom.</p>
          <a href="https://www.edweek.org/technology/teachers-turn-to-pen-and-paper-amid-ai-cheating-fears-survey-finds/2023/10" class="stat-source" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Education Week, October 2023</a>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-block">
          <div class="stat-number">80%</div>
          <p class="stat-body">increase in blue-book sales at UC Berkeley over two academic years.</p>
          <a href="https://www.insidehighered.com/news/deep-dives/2025/06/17/amid-ai-plagiarism-more-professors-turn-handwritten-work" class="stat-source" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Inside Higher Ed, June 2025</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="trend-closing">GradeVine is built for handwritten quizzes, tests, and lab work.</p>

      <div class="as-reported">
        <span class="as-reported-label">The shift to handwritten work, covered in</span>
        <div class="as-reported-logos">
          <span>Education Week</span>
          <span>Wall Street Journal</span>
          <span>Inside Higher Ed</span>
          <span>Axios</span>
          <span>Fox News</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Analytics value -->
  <section class="value-section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>What a paper gradebook can't show you.</h2>
      <p class="value-body">Class averages, grade distributions, per-question success rates, keyword coverage, and student trends across assignments.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Feedback value -->
  <section class="value-section alt">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Feedback on every student, without writing every word.</h2>
      <p class="value-body">Save the comments you write most often and tap to apply them on the next student — detailed feedback on every paper without starting from scratch each time.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Origin story -->
  <section class="origin">
    <div class="container">
      <h3>Built for one teacher first.</h3>
      <p>GradeVine was built by a developer for his teacher wife so he could spend a little more time with her. Made with her feedback every step of the way.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FAQ -->
  <section class="faq">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Common questions.</h2>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>How accurate is the grading?</summary>
        <p>When Smart evaluation is on, every score comes with a confidence rating. You can review and adjust any score. The final call is always yours.</p>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>Is Smart evaluation optional?</summary>
        <p>Yes. Transcription and student matching run in the background. <em>Smart evaluation</em> — which suggests correct, partial, or incorrect with a rationale — is opt-in and Premium. You see the suggestion; you make the call.</p>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>Where does student data go?</summary>
        <p>On your device. Synced through your personal iCloud. Never stored on GradeVine servers. Never used to train AI models.</p>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>What kinds of assessments work best?</summary>
        <p>Short-answer questions, lab questions, problem sets, and free-response work — handwritten or otherwise. GradeVine isn't built for essay-primary courses where the work is multi-page open-ended writing.</p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Pricing -->
  <section id="pricing" class="pricing">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Credit-based pricing.</h2>
      <p class="pricing-subtitle">Credits cover transcription — 1 credit per page scanned, or 1.5 credits per page with Smart evaluation turned on. Paid plans add rollover credits and Google Drive export.</p>

      <!-- Free tier elevated -->
      <div class="free-tier-hero">
        <div class="free-tier-hero-content">
          <h3>Start free</h3>
          <div class="free-price">Free</div>
          <div class="credits">30 credits/month</div>
          <p class="credits-note">Enough for about 1 small class assignment. No credit card required.</p>
          <a href="https://apps.apple.com/app/id6755069483" class="btn btn-primary">Download on the App Store</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="upgrade-divider">
        <span>Need more credits?</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Billing toggle -->
      <div class="billing-toggle">
        <button class="toggle-btn active" data-period="monthly">Monthly</button>
        <button class="toggle-btn" data-period="annual">Annual</button>
      </div>

      <div class="pricing-grid-paid">
        <div class="pricing-card featured">
          <div class="badge">Most Popular</div>
          <h3>Standard</h3>
          <div class="price monthly-price">$4.99<span>/mo</span></div>
          <div class="price annual-price" style="display:none;">$49.99<span>/yr</span></div>
          <div class="annual-savings" style="display:none;">Save $9.89/year</div>
          <div class="credits">1,000 credits/month</div>
          <p class="credits-note">Unused credits roll over month to month.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>All features included</li>
            <li>Google Drive export</li>
            <li>Rollover credits</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="pricing-card">
          <h3>Pro</h3>
          <div class="price monthly-price">$9.99<span>/mo</span></div>
          <div class="price annual-price" style="display:none;">$99.99<span>/yr</span></div>
          <div class="annual-savings" style="display:none;">Save $19.89/year</div>
          <div class="credits">5,000 credits/month</div>
          <p class="credits-note">Unused credits roll over month to month.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Everything in Standard</li>
            <li>5x the credits</li>
            <li>Built for heavy workloads</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="credit-calculator">
        <div class="calc-header">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="20" height="20">
            <rect x="4" y="2" width="16" height="20" rx="2" /><line x1="8" y1="6" x2="16" y2="6" /><line x1="8" y1="10" x2="10" y2="10" /><line x1="14" y1="10" x2="16" y2="10" /><line x1="8" y1="14" x2="10" y2="14" /><line x1="14" y1="14" x2="16" y2="14" /><line x1="8" y1="18" x2="16" y2="18" />
          </svg>
          <h4>Credit calculator</h4>
        </div>
        <div class="calc-inputs">
          <div class="calc-field">
            <label for="calc-students">Students</label>
            <div class="calc-stepper">
              <button type="button" class="stepper-btn" data-target="calc-students" data-dir="-1">-</button>
              <input type="number" id="calc-students" value="20" min="1" max="500" />
              <button type="button" class="stepper-btn" data-target="calc-students" data-dir="1">+</button>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="calc-field">
            <label for="calc-pages">Pages per assignment</label>
            <div class="calc-stepper">
              <button type="button" class="stepper-btn" data-target="calc-pages" data-dir="-1">-</button>
              <input type="number" id="calc-pages" value="1" min="1" max="50" />
              <button type="button" class="stepper-btn" data-target="calc-pages" data-dir="1">+</button>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="calc-field">
            <label for="calc-ai">Smart evaluation</label>
            <div class="calc-switch-wrap">
              <button type="button" id="calc-ai" class="calc-switch active" aria-pressed="true">
                <span class="calc-switch-knob"></span>
              </button>
              <span class="calc-switch-label" id="calc-ai-label">+0.5 credits/page</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="calc-result">
          <div class="calc-total">
            <span class="calc-total-number" id="calc-total">30</span>
            <span class="calc-total-label">credits per assignment</span>
          </div>
          <div class="calc-plan" id="calc-plan">
            <span class="credit-tag free-tag">Free</span>
            <span>Up to <strong id="calc-assignments">1</strong> assignment/month</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Final CTA -->
  <section class="final-cta">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Try GradeVine.</h2>
      <a href="https://apps.apple.com/app/id6755069483" class="btn btn-primary">Download on the App Store</a>
      <p class="hero-microcopy">Free to try. 30 credits. No card required.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Footer -->
  <footer class="footer">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="footer-content">
        <div class="footer-brand">
          <span class="logo-text">GradeVine</span>
          <p>Grading software for paper-and-pencil classrooms.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer-links">
          <div class="footer-col">
            <h4>Product</h4>
            <a href="#how-it-works">How it works</a>
            <a href="#pricing">Pricing</a>
            <a href="https://apps.apple.com/app/id6755069483">Download</a>
          </div>
          <div class="footer-col">
            <h4>Legal</h4>
            <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>
            <a href="/terms">Terms of Service</a>
          </div>
          <div class="footer-col">
            <h4>Support</h4>
            <a href="/support">Help &amp; FAQ</a>
            <a href="mailto:moses.harding.dev@gmail.com">Contact</a>
            <a href="/dashboard?login=1">Web dashboard</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="footer-bottom">
        <p>&copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} GradeVine. All rights reserved.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>
</Layout>

<style>
  /* Header */
  .header {
    position: fixed;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    z-index: 100;
    background: linear-gradient(
      135deg,
      var(--color-purple-deep),
      var(--color-purple)
    );
    box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(80, 2, 247, 0.25);
  }

  .nav {
    max-width: var(--max-width);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }

  .logo-text {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #fff;
  }

  .nav-links {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .nav-links a {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .nav-links a:hover {
    color: #fff;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  /* Buttons */
  .btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-button);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 1rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }

  .btn:hover {
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-red), var(--color-coral));
    color: #fff;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(255, 28, 54, 0.3);
  }

  .btn-primary:hover {
    box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(255, 28, 54, 0.4);
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }

  .btn-nav {
    padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
    color: #fff !important;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
  }

  .btn-nav:hover {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
  }

  /* Container */
  .container {
    max-width: var(--max-width);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 1.5rem;
  }

  /* Hero */
  .hero {
    padding: 8rem 1.5rem 4rem;
    background: #fff;
  }

  .hero-content {
    max-width: var(--max-width);
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 4rem;
  }

  .hero-carousel {
    flex: 0 0 300px;
    touch-action: pan-y;
  }

  .carousel-track {
    position: relative;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .carousel-track img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity 0.5s ease;
  }

  .carousel-track img:first-child {
    position: relative;
  }

  .carousel-track img.carousel-active {
    opacity: 1;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .carousel-dots {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .carousel-dot {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: none;
    background: var(--color-gray-300);
    cursor: pointer;
    padding: 0;
    transition: background 0.2s;
  }

  .carousel-dot.active {
    background: var(--color-purple-deep);
  }

  .hero-text {
    flex: 1;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .hero h1 {
    font-size: 3.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--color-gray-900);
  }

  .highlight {
    background: linear-gradient(
      135deg,
      var(--color-purple-deep),
      var(--color-purple)
    );
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
  }

  .hero-subtitle {
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-gray-700);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .hero-cta {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .hero-microcopy {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--color-gray-600);
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* How it works */
  .how-it-works {
    padding: 5rem 0;
  }

  .how-it-works > .container > h2 {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 2.25rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .how-step {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 4rem;
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  .how-step.reverse {
    flex-direction: row-reverse;
  }

  .how-step-text {
    flex: 1;
  }

  .how-step-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .how-step-number {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 36px;
    height: 36px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-purple-deep), var(--color-purple));
    color: #fff;
    border-radius: 50%;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .how-step-text h3 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-gray-900);
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .how-step-text p {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: var(--color-gray-700);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .how-step-visual {
    flex: 0 0 320px;
  }

  .how-step-visual video {
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
    background: #000;
  }

  .how-also {
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--color-gray-600);
    font-size: 1rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  /* Trend strip */
  .trend-strip {
    padding: 5rem 0;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-purple-deep), var(--color-purple));
    color: #fff;
  }

  .trend-strip h2 {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 2.25rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    color: #fff;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .stat-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 2.5rem;
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .stat-block {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .stat-number {
    font-size: 4.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1;
    color: #fff;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  }

  .stat-body {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
